WEBVTT

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:09.201
This video shows how to add a subject on your phone. You will create a new subject, and then look at where subjects are given to classes.

00:00:10.872 --> 00:00:22.728
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Academics, and then choose Subjects. Subjects are shown as cards, and the tabs at the top lead to class assignments and class teachers.

00:00:23.297 --> 00:00:28.817
On the Subjects tab, tap Add Subject. A form opens.

00:00:33.435 --> 00:00:47.955
Type the name of the subject, for example Science. The code is filled in for you, and you can change it. You can also add a short description. If students can choose the subject, tick Elective subject.

00:00:49.522 --> 00:00:57.490
Tap Create. A message confirms that the subject was added, and the new subject appears as a card in the list.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:14.844
To use the subject in a class, tap the Class Assignments tab. Here you give each class its subjects and teachers.

00:01:18.039 --> 00:01:25.215
The subject is added. Repeat these steps for every subject, and then assign them to your classes.
